<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="section" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #07381b 0%, #0d562b 100%); color: #fff; padding: 60px 0;">
  <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
    <span class="hero-badge" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">Audiology Insights</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 14px; color: #fff;">
      How Do Hearing Aids Work?
    </h1>
    <p style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; color: #d1fae5; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      Hearing aids are small, intelligent electronic devices that help you hear sounds clearly and comfortably. Rather than simply making everything louder, modern digital devices refine and optimize sound delivery straight to your brain.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- The 3 Essential Components -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Core Architecture</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">The 3 Essential Components of a Hearing Aid</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">How physical acoustic sound waves are transformed into clear speech understanding.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3-col">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-box">🎙️</div>
        <h3>1. The Microphone</h3>
        <p>Captures environmental sound waves from all directions and converts acoustic air vibrations into precise digital electrical pulses.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-box">⚡</div>
        <h3>2. The Sound Processor</h3>
        <p>The high-speed microchip brain that filters noise, separates speech from ambient clutter, and applies specific amplification only to your weakened frequencies.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-box">📢</div>
        <h3>3. The Speaker (Receiver)</h3>
        <p>Converts the cleaned, digitally amplified audio back into rich acoustic sound waves that travel smoothly into your ear canal towards the eardrum.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How Sound Is Actually Improved -->
<section class="section section-bg-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Acoustic Engineering</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">How Sound Is Actually Improved</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Smart algorithms tailored to human auditory perception.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2-col">
      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 28px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px;">Frequency-Specific Gain</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Most people lose clarity in high-pitched consonants (like 's', 'f', 'th') while retaining low pitches. Modern aids only amplify the exact pitches you struggle with.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 28px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px;">Background Noise Reduction</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Intelligent noise cancelers constantly identify steady droning noises (air conditioners, traffic, engine rumble) and suppress them so human voices stand out.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 28px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px;">Automatic Acoustic Adaptation</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Sensors analyze your soundscape hundreds of times per second and seamlessly transition between quiet conversation, music, car driving, and bustling outdoor modes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 28px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px;">Loudness Protection</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Sudden harsh noises (slamming doors, dropped plates, honking cars) are instantly suppressed in milliseconds so your ears are protected from uncomfortably loud bursts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Action Call -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container-narrow" style="text-align: center;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 14px;">
      Same Working Principle, Vital Professional Fitting
    </h2>
    <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      Even the world's most advanced hearing aid cannot perform properly without precise diagnostic testing and real-ear measurement (REM) tuning by trained audiologists.
    </p>
    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" data-open-appointment="uttara">Book Professional Clinical Fitting</button>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
